{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0237_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0237_story_06_synopsis", "source_sha256": "29a4c3f3ef176ea5f8f8b365b3ce380c7548bfbac30dcdd187e5be2f6ccf0f1a", "ja": "学園祭当日、実行委員の生徒達に案内されて\n校内を見学する琴葉と海美。そこで新曲を\n歌う事を生徒達に話すが、理由は語らない。\nそして本番。海美と琴葉は、女の子達への\nメッセージと共に、新曲を届けるのだった。", "zh": "学园祭当天，琴叶与海美在执行委员学生们的带领下\n参观校内。两人在此向学生们透露了会演唱新曲，\n却并未说明理由。到了正式演出时，\n海美和琴叶将新曲连同对女孩子们的\n心意一同传递了出去。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0237_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0237_story_06_1000_null", "source_sha256": "7c3982df3ed2bc56369b11351d280ef20318b8d958d2d8c54de7bfec851cb370", "ja": "学園祭当日……", "zh": "校园祭当天……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0237_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0237_story_06_1001_029umi", "source_sha256": "8491077f1a86a7c66f2268d9dbd78a61463aaf1d3a56238e23c89e81220a757c", "ja": "へ～、いろんな企画があるんだねーっ！\nあっ、あっちでお笑いのステージもやるみたいだよ！", "zh": "哇～，原来有这么多不同的活动呢——！\n啊，那边好像也要上演搞笑节目哦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0237_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0237_story_06_1002_017kth", "source_sha256": "8b239c269ec12c424913844e42b14fc8655c0cee25d99ba67e6d2a74ad0eaac3", "ja": "私たちの他にも、楽しそうな出し物がたくさん……\nにぎやかになりそうだね。", "zh": "除了我们之外，还有好多看起来很有趣的节目……\n感觉会很热闹呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0237_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0237_story_06_1003_yuduki", "source_sha256": "a6f2275a81dfc6773705627c21a2ccc6607c213e3fe58b54d890db1b1e7e98ce", "ja": "体育館のステージは、一日中ライブがありますよ！\nもし興味があったら、見学もできますので。", "zh": "体育馆的舞台一整天都有现场演出哦！\n如果感兴趣的话，也可以去参观。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0237_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0237_story_06_1004_017kth", "source_sha256": "96be4e601f64ec849fefcc4cd975f147fe1d35eb2fbfee08cd517d0358af960c", "ja": "そうだね。演劇部の公演は、興味があるかも……\nせっかくだから、見てみたいな。", "zh": "是啊。演剧部的公演，我可能会感兴趣……\n难得有这个机会，真想去看看。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0237_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0237_story_06_1005_029umi", "source_sha256": "bd83f87de565a3ea6099760aa7eb1d56f2e06d25a76d78858fa3b1a469a4d7a1", "ja": "柚月ちゃんとさくなちゃんは、\n出し物とか参加してないの？", "zh": "柚月和咲奈没有参加什么节目之类的吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0237_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0237_story_06_1006_yuduki", "source_sha256": "c0ca8876a9d33f3f5dff47547aab8b9121945af095c1a6b93381f5f2f0994024", "ja": "そうですね。実行委員が忙しくて、他はとても……。\nあ、でも、クラスの模擬店には参加しますよ！", "zh": "是啊。活动筹备委员会那边很忙，其他的就实在……  \n啊，不过，我会参加班级的摊位哦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0237_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0237_story_06_1007_sakuna", "source_sha256": "66fe1507de0a1a19f6c4172bd0280cccb4cac5d712b48987081db22d97537cdb", "ja": "私たちのクラスは、カフェなんです。\nラテアートをやるので、よかったら来てください！", "zh": "我们班开的是咖啡馆。\n会有拿铁拉花，欢迎来玩！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0237_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0237_story_06_1008_029umi", "source_sha256": "97ea6a30d785598211864cd9b6a4556d87a4635fa3e1073d7002a0ab34731916", "ja": "そうなの！？　私も、前にお仕事でやったことあるよ！\nキレイに作るの、すっごく難しいんだよね～。", "zh": "这样啊！？我之前工作的时候也做过哦！\n要做得漂亮，可难了呢～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0237_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0237_story_06_1009_029umi", "source_sha256": "b04baf385b7a1b87819587fe7a8e5d611d7ab5e10c07f0a6b29ce26d1abd301c", "ja": "ライブが終わったら行ってもいいか、\nあとで{$P$}に聞いてみよーっと☆", "zh": "等演出结束后能不能去，我待会儿去问问{$P$}吧——☆", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0237_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0237_story_06_1010_p", "source_sha256": "49bfe61be1bd10259e53d5bad6bc3220eb1d0b2d49a5469bea08f9d556e8c144", "ja": "海美、琴葉、見学できたか？　そろそろ\nリハーサルの時間だから、移動しようか。", "zh": "海美、琴叶，看得怎么样了？差不多\n到彩排时间了，我们走吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0237_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0237_story_06_1011_017kth", "source_sha256": "c98c95d7f5d73f62da82b31b3f417c64c4c6cd60ac540d4a393167d901567d95", "ja": "わかりました。", "zh": "好的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0237_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0237_story_06_1012_p", "source_sha256": "e9a88ec44fb72e2dfa4ec7c827aa48e9a5324493c9b178808cb22fe1a16ed9e5", "ja": "それと、新曲の歌唱だけど、OKが出たよ。\nふたりとも、そのつもりでよろしくな！", "zh": "另外，新歌的演唱已经通过了。\n你们两个就按这个准备吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0237_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0237_story_06_1013_029umi", "source_sha256": "957b2ae2d360cf188c8b4c7842835064541945cbf2b2a291a84eca6e715284e1", "ja": "えへへっ、了解っ☆\n楽しみだね！", "zh": "嘿嘿，了解☆\n好期待啊！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0237_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0237_story_06_1014_yuduki", "source_sha256": "8780b8c57c21330e4eb0689005f8eab11364c9a864e98a1c2186d9397899657b", "ja": "？　あの。新曲って、何の話でしょうか……？", "zh": "？那个，新歌是怎么回事……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0237_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0237_story_06_1015_017kth", "source_sha256": "807cd469e7c5704a5c1fa715eb968025e4db23f4ed56b372965efe92ab43e314", "ja": "あ、まだふたりには話してなかったよね。\n実は今日のために、新曲を用意してきたんだ。", "zh": "啊，还没跟你们两个人说过吧。\n其实，我为今天准备了一首新歌。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0237_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0237_story_06_1016_sakuna", "source_sha256": "2d6ef709ed23b7debf1682cf4433a892cd9a6eca410216a6dd7915c9a33ac179", "ja": "えっ……そ、そうなんですか！？\nでも、どうして急に……？", "zh": "诶……是、是这样吗！？\n不过，为什么突然……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0237_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0237_story_06_1017_029umi", "source_sha256": "83271f00e61d7b3cfff32d35eadc7a2151663aceb8eea279a63449115948e3dd", "ja": "えっと……まだ、ナイショ！　でも、\nステージを見てくれたら、きっとわかると思うっ！", "zh": "那个……暂时还是秘密！不过，只要你看了舞台表演，我想你一定就会明白了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0237_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0237_story_06_1018_029umi", "source_sha256": "1c870d86b4e625a3489f852330cc634f255571a7881a0e9640624b1e4ef53c22", "ja": "だから、楽しみにしてて！\nすごーーーく、素敵な曲だから☆", "zh": "所以，要好好期待哦！\n因为是首超级——超级棒的歌☆", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0237_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0237_story_06_1019_017kth", "source_sha256": "cba7d927b684bafa46e9228be8c385f464ac2ded7830fb1a717b068a71c85746", "ja": "絶対に、楽しかったって言わせてみせる。\nだから期待してて、ふたりとも！", "zh": "我一定会让你们两个说出“好开心”给你们看的。所以，期待着吧，两位！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0237_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0237_story_06_1020_yuduki", "source_sha256": "78dfcda3f77cfcc3264930df522f8507c0f30fb4aa9a4f8119b0b05a125f0135", "ja": "……わかりました！　海美ちゃんと琴葉ちゃんが\nそう言うなら、楽しみにしてます！　ね、さくな！", "zh": "……我知道了！既然海美和琴叶都这么说了，\n那我可就期待着了！对吧，朔奈！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0237_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0237_story_06_1021_sakuna", "source_sha256": "b3d33c01a80bc720a6c15e84aea4613f9c2a1c34f7811803c2868e4e80d6f61e", "ja": "う、うん！", "zh": "嗯、嗯！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0237_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0237_story_06_1022_029umi", "source_sha256": "9bf30a68eff1d6ff7f306e3b01ea4d8ed2ff6265c1458a41f35b2e8d46751656", "ja": "ありがとっ！　それじゃ琴葉、行こっか！", "zh": "谢谢！那琴叶，我们走吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0237_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0237_story_06_1023_017kth", "source_sha256": "8cec5a9994c524e42325dc5dca9033c2cebe967d2fed8a4f8d3974fbfcf297d3", "ja": "うん。がんばろうね、海美ちゃん！", "zh": "嗯。一起加油吧，海美！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0237_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0237_story_06_1024_null", "source_sha256": "efc1d82f27c00c2cd66242ba3968b75b5084f0ad635f478df59f2ea4ca40369e", "ja": "そして……", "zh": "然后……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0237_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0237_story_06_1025_029umi", "source_sha256": "87aaf225f2548c060942c684083fe969e7273b6c37a43a77840ee56ac70833b5", "ja": "みんなーっ！　アンコールありがと～っ！\n今日のステージ、楽しんでくれたーっ！？", "zh": "大家——！谢谢你们的安可～！\n今天的舞台，大家玩得开心吗——！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0237_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0237_story_06_1026_017kth", "source_sha256": "6d4cf112b504bd6a911d27a4903ec4f54887461f02d066b5046dfd6f8b28294e", "ja": "たくさんの声援、ありがとうございました！\nみなさんのおかげで、私たちもすごく楽しかったです！", "zh": "谢谢大家热情的声援！\n多亏了大家，我们也度过了非常开心的时光！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0237_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0237_story_06_1027_029umi", "source_sha256": "349438f5109701bd08883b5622794fc7bd086ae33abd366e3da6814dc52016fd", "ja": "アンコールでは、そんな感謝の気持ちも込めて……\nなんと、新曲を歌っちゃうよーっ☆", "zh": "在安可环节，我们也要带着这份感谢之情……\n居然要唱新歌啦——☆", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0237_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0237_story_06_1028_audience", "source_sha256": "04101ceaa92507abef43b29f635f686325d375eefb272a218e5862d459f54056", "ja": "オオオオオ！！？", "zh": "哦哦哦哦哦！！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0237_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0237_story_06_1029_029umi", "source_sha256": "e79273501c279f2c52148e1f500032a33e439e417b709360f2b37d3d11939ef5", "ja": "あっ、歌う前に、私たちからメッセージ！\n会場のみんな……特に、女の子たちへ！", "zh": "啊，在开唱之前，我们有话想对大家说！\n会场的各位……尤其是女孩子们！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0237_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0237_story_06_1030_029umi", "source_sha256": "27cb77ed2469990cabd4296d8faa7b9261ce85b8548d36b598dbe04bcab31469", "ja": "今から歌う新曲は、女の子としての私たちが、\nいろっ……んな気持ちを込めた曲なんだ！　ね、琴葉♪", "zh": "接下来要唱的新歌，是我们以女孩子的身份，倾注了各……种心情的歌曲！对吧，琴叶♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0237_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0237_story_06_1031_017kth", "source_sha256": "630025c28b1dc12105fb0d09192e5c500db3a926e48e35b1628f8ea6d3bda9e0", "ja": "うん！　私たちふたりで、いろんなことを考えて……\nその思いを、今回、歌で伝えたいと思いました。", "zh": "嗯！我们两个人一起想了很多事情……这一次，希望能用歌声传达这份心意。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0237_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0237_story_06_1032_017kth", "source_sha256": "6db6b0b928fe8c14378e6ebe0d58e48053e6069f065fd8eb104672cea9a163bc", "ja": "私たちはアイドルであると同時に、\nひとりの女の子です。……だから！", "zh": "我们既是偶像，同时也是普通的女孩子。……所以！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0237_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0237_story_06_1033_029umi", "source_sha256": "d5a0fb88b66bd326d020336afab8b62bb7d09ba2916f4a2b2daef95097fec938", "ja": "そんな私たちの、めいっぱいのワガママが\n詰まった新曲、聞いてくださいっ！", "zh": "请听这首充满了我们任性心愿的新歌！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
